  "createdAt": "2026-10-22T17:18:16.447Z",
  "description": "Bird's-nest fern, about 1.9 m across and 0.74 m tall: low brown nest mound whose widest ring sits 6 cm below the ground contact (bottom -0.18 m), so only its cap shows between the frond bases; five upright and ten arching strap fronds, bright green with dark midribs. One wind node `foliage`; TEXCOORD_0.y wind weight 0.05 at the nest to 0.9 at outer frond tips. 564 triangles.",
  "brief": "Crescent Cove grove understorey bird's-nest fern (Holodeck world tropical-island). Metres, +Y up, origin at the ground contact. Turn-5 fix: the dark nest ellipsoid was centred 8 cm above the pivot, so its lower half read as a dark disc standing on the sand; it is now centred 6 cm below the pivot (cap only above ground) and the frond bases start 4 cm up, inside the cap.",
